    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "A market is a place or system where buyers and sellers meet. A weekly market sells goods on fixed days; a shopping mall has many shops; an online market works through the internet.\nA wholesale market sells goods in large amounts to traders and a retail market sells small amounts to consumers.\nPrices depend on demand and supply. If demand is high and supply is low, prices rise."
    }
